  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting sports and physical activity at the local level</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Le&#xf3;n is one of those cities in Latin America that understands the importance of sport for its sustainable development, and the role it has in its social strengthening agenda. Le&#xf3;n was proclaimed the American Capital of Sports 2023 an din this framework we will establish a regional network. The creation of a Latin American network of sports cities has unbeatable conditions for its realization and would constitute a necessary and irreplaceable contribution to the development of cities and sports in the region. Likewise, the participation of LAC in the 2023 MINEPS Conference is foreseen through this project.</narrative>
  </description>
